  "content": "\n\n<p>[预告片制作中 - 即将推出！]</p>\n<p>⚠️ 重要提示：此为 Alpha/抢先体验版本，与最终成品存在较大差异，开发工作预计于7月底结束。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d13ac17ef50ed090e7d21fcae0caf8958eeece3d.png\" alt=\"由 Sable 提供支持\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Maxenonyme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-FF0000?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Ucsj7fatMj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<h1>关于 Create: Deep Seas</h1>\n<p><strong>Create: Deep Seas</strong>（又名 Create Submarine）在 Create 模组和 Sable 物理引擎的基础上进行了扩展，使玩家能够建造、驾驶并在完全功能化、基于物理规律的潜艇中生存。</p>\n<p>本模组分为<strong>两个部分</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>潜艇系统：提供压力机制、氧气供应以及与潜艇相关的所有功能。</li>\n<li>深渊：一个未来将加入的生态系/维度，包含特有的生物与建筑结构，为建造和改进潜艇提供实际用途。</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>依赖项</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-aeronautics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Aeronautics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sable</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>** 可选，但三者需至少安装其一。（仅适用于模组 2.0.0 及以上版本；低于该版本必须安装 Create Addition。）</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Addition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-new-age\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create New Age</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpower-grid%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Power Grid</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>支持的模组</h1>\n<h4>- Sodium（任意版本）</h4>\n<h4>-<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopycats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copycat+</a></h4>\n<h4>-<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwakes-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wake</a></h4>\n<h1>附加模组</h1>\n<h4>-<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion</a>（用于连接纹理）</h4>\n<h4>-<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flithostitched\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lithostitched</a>（深化海洋所必需）</h4>\n<h1>鸣谢</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>开发者：</strong> Maxenonyme, Cogfly, Zinc Studios</li>\n<li><strong>建模师：</strong> Xamelo</li>\n<li><strong>贡献者：</strong> T418, Soub, Mruranium</li>\n<li><strong>美术：</strong> Marume, RandomePigeon, Funado, daileta, Houslander, Myxma</li>\n<li><strong>Alpha 测试员：</strong> Gothci, Myxma, sant, qkback, Kuko, Tormi, Plasmori, Deron4iik</li>\n</ul>",
